office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -98.8pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">신청 자격 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">졸업예정자 중 졸업요건을 모두 충족였으나 졸업 하지 않고 재학을 희망하는 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">졸업논문</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">전공시험포함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">및 졸업외국어 불합격자 등 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">추가서류 제출 등으로 졸업요건을 충족할 수 있는 자 포함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -39.4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">졸업외국어 자격인정 서류</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(2</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">차기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2015.07.20.(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)~07.22.(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: